  "uncertain": [
    "The rear view shows nine individually silkscreened round pads (TXD, RXD, GND, RST, USB+, USB-, 3.3V, IO8, RF-IO9) that may be test points; each recorded as a single-pad connector",
    "USB+ and USB- are printed vertically between the GND/RST pads and the two lower pads; assigning USB+ to the lower-left and USB- to the lower-right pad is inferred",
    "TXD and RXD are printed vertically beside the top two left pads; TXD assigned to the upper pad and RXD to the lower pad by proximity"
  ],
  "notes": "SDIO table also shows SH (shield) rows above pin 20/19 and below pin 2/1 with GND on both sides; these shield tabs are not numbered pins and are not included. Table prints RF_IO9/RF_IO2 with underscore while the pad silkscreen prints RF-IO9. Labels read from the table; even pins in the left column, odd in the right."
